g&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hat5_islambol.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=12195611","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"\"My Deputy Grand Vizier! My imperial decree has been that, if not contrary to current law, the word of Konstantiniye is not be printed.\" (On the matter of printing \u0130sl\u00e2mbol instead of 'Kostantiniyye' on new coins) (handwritten rescript (<i>hatt-i humayun</i>) dated ca. 1788, beginning of reign of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Selim_III\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Selim III\">en:Selim III</a>)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1453","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"12250638":{"pageid":12250638,"ns":6,"title":"File:Iii-selimin-hatti.png","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":69903,"width":886,"height":941,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/Iii-selimin-hatti.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":1699,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/Iii-selimin-hatti.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":1699},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/Iii-selimin-hatti.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Iii-selimin-hatti.png","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=12250638","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"A <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/hatt-%C4%B1_h%C3%BCmayun\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:hatt-\u0131 h\u00fcmayun\">hatt-\u0131 h\u00fcmayun</a> written by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Selim_III\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Selim III\">Selim III</a> to his <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Vizier\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Grand Vizier\">Grand Vizier</a> regarding the supply of meat to <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Istanbul\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Istanbul\">Istanbul</a>. The Grand Vizier reports on efforts to ensure that the people of Istanbul will not lack in meat, as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ramadan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Ramadan\">Ramadan</a> is approaching. He writes that he has always strived on the the matter of meat supply, that following the Sultan's previous hatt-\u0131 h\u00fcmayun on white to have more sheep delivered to Istanbul, decrees were sent to the provinces, messengers of the court were appointed and dispatched and that people will not suffer from a lack of meat during Ramadan. Upon this memorandum, Selim III writes (on top, with a thick pen) his appreciation: \"It has become my imperial knowledge. Do even more in the future. Let me see you.\"","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"late 18th century?","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"27098873":{"pageid":27098873,"ns":6,"title":"File:III. Selim ve IV. Mustafa'n\u0131n elyaz\u0131lar\u0131.png","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":513595,"width":406,"height":468,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/III._Selim_ve_IV._Mustafa%27n%C4%B1n_elyaz%C4%B1lar%C4%B1.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":1844,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/III._Selim_ve_IV._Mustafa%27n%C4%B1n_elyaz%C4%B1lar%C4%B1.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":1844},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/III._Selim_ve_IV._Mustafa%27n%C4%B1n_elyaz%C4%B1lar%C4%B1.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:III._Selim_ve_IV._Mustafa%27n%C4%B1n_elyaz%C4%B1lar%C4%B1.png","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=27098873","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"III. Selim and IV. Document with Mustafa's handwritings. III in the lower row. In the sentence written by Selim, it is ordered to give 50,000 cents to the Hamidiye Foundation on condition that it is repaid. III. Selim was deposed before this order was fulfilled, replaced by IV. Mustafa has arrived. IV. Mustafa is also III. He wrote a sentence on Selim's handwriting stating that he approved the order with his own handwriting.\n<p><b>III. Selim:</b> Validem Keth\u00fcdas\u0131 A\u011fa, let him deliver it to Esma Sultan Keth\u00fcda on the condition that he acts fifty thousand gurus from Vakf-\u0131 Hamidiye.\n</p>\n<b>IV. Mustafa:</b> \u0130hsan-\u0131 H\u00fcm\u00e2y\u00fbnum was.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1807","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"133522679":{"pageid":133522679,"ns":6,"title":"File:Sultan of two lands and khan of two seas.png","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":585581,"width":784,"height":416,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/Sultan_of_two_lands_and_khan_of_two_seas.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":849,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/Sultan_of_two_lands_and_khan_of_two_seas.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":849},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/Sultan_of_two_lands_and_khan_of_two_seas.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sultan_of_two_lands_and_khan_of_two_seas.png","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=133522679","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"The title \"[the] sultan of [the] two lands and [the] khan of [the] two seas\" on Selim III's coin (mint 1789 AD)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2023-06-24","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]}}}}